      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>Remember</b>: <i>After recovering an opponent''s ball outside their
    own penalty area, the GK follows Any Other Scenario and may carry it back during
    movement. Pickup is offered only when the entire Movement Phase completes successfully
    with that keeper still in possession inside their own box, before Final Thirds.
    Outside-box phase ends defer the choice. An eligible opponent-ball recovery inside
    the box still uses Save and Hold.</i>'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
