  m_text: Shuffle the cards and place 4 of them face up. You choose 1 of these cards,
    your opponent chooses next. You then pick 1 of the remaining cards and your opponent
    takes the final card. Repeat this process with the rest of the player cards,
    taking turns with who picks first. Keep going until you both have 15 outfield
    players.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
