  m_text: If the goalkeeper wins a legal catch inside their own penalty area they
    <link="goalkeeper"><color=#79CEF2><u>save and hold</u></color></link>. Outside
    their own box they use Heading 0, and a win must be headed away as an ordinary
    headed pass.
