  m_text: "\u2022 Goals can be scored from loose balls! If the ball passes within
    1 hex of the <link=\"goalkeeper\"><color=#79CEF2><u>goalkeeper</u></color></link>,
    the goalkeeper needs to roll a 5 or a 6\_ or 10+ combined with Saving to save
    it! If the ball passes more than 1 hex from the goalkeeper, it cannot be saved."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
