  m_text: '<b>If the attacker rolls a 1 when shooting</b>: The activate final thirds
    action must follow. The GK must be positioned inside the 6 yard box when taking
    the kick. From here, a standard pass or a GK kick can follow. The standard pass
    can be intercepted, the GK Kick follows the rules stated above.'
