  m_text: When the ball qualifies for a new entry into the defending penalty box,
    resolve the separate 1-hex goalkeeper move first, then offer the Pace move. Taking
    or declining either move does not consume the other. Out-of-bounds restarts,
    offside and ended actions do not resume this response sequence.
