  m_text: At the end of each half, roll the dice and add the result to the referee's
    Leniency. Play continues for that many Actions before the half/match is over.
    <b>The maximum is 7 actions per regulation half and 3 actions per extra-time
    half. The only time an action can be exceeded by 1 is if a penalty is awarded
    in the last action of the half.</b>
