      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Official Online games: Flip the GK deck so that all cards are face down,
    shuffle the deck at will, Take 4 cards, Roll the dice to see who picks first
    and pick two each. Many people chose to lay all the cards down to the pitch,
    (by selecting\_take 14 -all of them) then the two managers have all the cards
    in their view so select from there."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
