  m_text: If your opponent crosses the ball into the box, you can challenge to catch
    the ball. Your goalkeeper can do that by challenging for the Header (after the
    High Pass) using their Aerial Ability attribute. If the ball is aimed within
    2 hexes of you, then you can choose to have a duel with your opponent (see <link="heading"><color=#79CEF2><u>Heading</u></color></link>).
