      m_Calls: []
  m_text: B10 is fully determined as the crowd is cheering. He calls another nutmeg
    on R5, as he has just enough Pace to reach the other side of him. For the sake
    of the example he wins the duel fair and square, and calls a snapshot. But B10
    rolls a 1 so shoots over the bar...but it was a world class move!
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
