      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\u2022 During the attacking team's player movements in a <link=\"movement_phase\"><color=#79CEF2><u>Movement
    Phase</u></color></link> if a player has or takes the ball in the opposition's
    penalty area OR immediately when a <link=\"loose_ball\"><color=#79CEF2><u>Loose
    Ball</u></color></link> hits an attacking player in the opposition's penalty
    area or outside the box within shooting distance."
