  m_text: Injuries have <b>immediate</b> effect. This means that if you spend 1 Pace,
    and get in a Defender's ZOI, he rolls for a steal and fouls, if you pick up an
    injury, and decide to play on, you now have one pace less to run as you are already
    injured.
