  m_text: Just before the snapshot is taken, 1 opponent is allowed to move any player
    2 hexes in an attempt to deflect the shot (see <link="loose_ball"><color=#79CEF2><u>Loose
    Ball</u></color></link>). This can include the <link="goalkeeper"><color=#79CEF2><u>goalkeeper</u></color></link>.
