  m_text: Use the distance stick to work out where you want to pass to. If your opponent
    is within 1 hex of the player making the pass and directly in the path of the
    high pass, the pass cannot be made. Place the ball where you want it to go. The
    ball must always be aimed to land on the <link="heading"><color=#79CEF2><u>Head</u></color></link>
    of one of your players.
