  m_text: Roll a dice. If the dice roll is equal to or higher than the referee's
    Leniency attribute, the player who made the foul receives a yellow card. Any
    player who receives a second yellow card is then shown a red card and has to
    leave the pitch immediately. Play must stop for a free kick or penalty if a player
    receives a red card.
