  m_text: 10. Defence rolls with all declared players, including the GK if nominated.
    The best combined score wins. In this digital edition, a goalkeeper tied for
    their team's best defensive score takes priority; other ties retain the first
    rolled player. A keeper outside their own penalty area uses Heading 0 and heads
    the ball away on a win; only a legal catch inside their own penalty area uses
    Aerial Ability and leads to Save and Hold.
